    {
      "source": "Note: Prefer the use of <a href=\"SimpleLocaleContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.i18n\"><code>SimpleLocaleContext</code></a> when only setting\na Locale but no TimeZone.",
      "translation": "注意：当仅设置 `Locale` 而不设置时区时，请优先使用 <a href=\"SimpleLocaleContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.i18n\"><code>SimpleLocaleContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new SimpleTimeZoneAwareLocaleContext that exposes the specified\nLocale and TimeZone. Every <a href=\"SimpleLocaleContext.html#getLocale()\"><code>SimpleLocaleContext.getLocale()</code></a> call will return the given\nLocale, and every <a href=\"#getTimeZone()\"><code>getTimeZone()</code></a> call will return the given TimeZone.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `SimpleTimeZoneAwareLocaleContext`，以暴露指定的 `Locale` 和 `TimeZone`。每次调用 `<a href=\"SimpleLocaleContext.html#getLocale()\"><code>SimpleLocaleContext.getLocale()</code></a>` 都将返回给定的 `Locale`，而每次调用 `<a href=\"#getTimeZone()\"><code>getTimeZone()</code></a>` 都将返回给定的 `TimeZone`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
